From 3eafcdc9a381784464f51de06a77d8a2e17bb7f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 11:01:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Added: Choose the language of the app

Settings > Language and Language in the tab bar settings menu choose
the language of the app: the system's, English, Korean, Japanese or
Chinese. The activities, the service and the application wrap their
base context with the chosen locale, so that their resources are in it,
and the current activity is created again when it changes. The terminal
activity is created again when it is started after the language was
changed in the settings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GLNsTPnn2xKUQ4uFcevT6G
